{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And He said.</b> Scripture says: Let the earth put forth — “Let the waters swarm” (Genesis 1:20), “Let the earth bring forth” (ibid. 1:24). Behold, there is power in earth and in water to act at the command of HaShem, and this is the <i>toldot</i>." "And the sense of תדשא is like תצמיח [cause to grow]." "<b>Whose seed is in it,</b> that the seed is in the fruit, and each one keeps to its kind."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:34.514421527Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}